      <title>Jockey T. Marsden replaces suspended rider on Velvet Thunder in Flemington feature</title>
      <link>https://www.news.com.au/sport/superracing/jockey-marsden-replaces-suspended-rider-velvet-thunder-flemington/news-story/0a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9?from=rss-basic</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">0a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator>Superracing staff</dc:creator>
      <category>Superracing</category>
      <description>Velvet Thunder's connections have turned to in-form hoop T. Marsden for Saturday's Group 2 at Flemington after the horse's regular rider copped a careless riding suspension at Caulfield.</description>
      <media:content url="https://content.api.news/v3/images/bin/0a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9" type="image/jpeg" width="650" height="366">
